00:00:07.797 --> 00:00:08.562
Hi!

00:00:08.586 --> 00:00:09.586
I'm Ana.

00:00:09.672 --> 00:00:11.460
Welcome to 'What to Say!'

00:00:32.239 --> 00:00:36.039
Do you know what to say when you talk about other people?

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:41.022
 Listen out for useful language for talking about other people.

00:00:41.483 --> 00:00:44.647
