00:00:44.858 --> 00:00:46.436
after this.

00:00:47.952 --> 00:00:49.686
How's your new project going?

00:00:49.897 --> 00:00:51.430
It's going really well.

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:52.540
Great.

00:00:52.892 --> 00:00:54.938
Do you work with the digital team?

00:00:54.978 --> 00:00:57.711
Yes, I'm helping them with a new website.

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:00.063
So, do you know Anya Patel?

00:01:00.244 --> 00:01:03.267
Yes, I do. I just emailed her.

00:01:03.584 --> 00:01:05.193
She's lovely, isn't she?

00:01:05.701 --> 00:01:07.901
I worked with her in my last job.

00:01:08.092 --> 00:01:10.060
Yeah, I like her a lot.

00:01:10.248 --> 00:01:12.537
She's &lt;i&gt;very&lt;/i&gt; good at her job.

00:01:12.616 --> 00:01:14.882
She's an &lt;i&gt;excellent&lt;/i&gt; businessperson.

00:01:15.357 --> 00:01:16.029
Really?

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:19.529
Yeah, she &lt;i&gt;always&lt;/i&gt; gets what she wants.

00:01:19.951 --> 00:01:20.951
Oh …

00:01:21.998 --> 00:01:25.818
I still need to discuss the contract with her.

00:01:26.616 --> 00:01:27.616
I see.

00:01:28.194 --> 00:01:29.194
OK …

00:01:30.663 --> 00:01:31.663
That's her!

00:01:32.202 --> 00:01:33.202
Good luck!

00:01:34.716 --> 00:01:35.716
Thanks.

00:01:44.138 --> 00:01:45.896
Hello, Anya.

00:01:45.935 --> 00:01:47.002
Noelia speaking!

00:01:48.343 --> 00:01:49.225
Hello again!

00:01:49.835 --> 00:01:51.084
Good luck, Noelia!

00:01:51.678 --> 00:01:57.186
